{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7000_place", "source_sha256": "993a9595a1c19f627941171ad057091a1d837837fd0bf87ab09d389ae73c401a", "ja": "洋館", "zh": "洋馆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7001_p", "source_sha256": "c80670560757d84caba8cd87b6b293289b5d09b9159ca82b83f6ab8c930ac435", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影。\nテーマは『スケルトン少女のロックバンド』だ！）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的拍摄。\n主题是“骷髅少女的摇滚乐队”！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7002_050jul", "source_sha256": "34751b75a8af21e0f3fd150eff14dfa67616c61ef79788ea015f54606002211f", "ja": "{$P$}、今いいか？\n撮影の方向性で、ちょっと悩んでてさ。", "zh": "{$P$}，现在方便吗？\n我对拍摄的方向有点拿不定主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7003_p", "source_sha256": "128d5efb29745bce0aaa1e2caa8f4f66986f4bc899929b20d1afb5f226d5502e", "ja": "もちろん。でも意外だな。\nテーマ的にジュリアの得意分野だと思ってたけど。", "zh": "当然可以。不过真意外啊。我还以为从主题来看，这是茱莉亚的拿手领域呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7004_050jul", "source_sha256": "d1dae6205811440d4f3b7d4d6daf5efc1bd994907909550d5a13247fcf329311", "ja": "まぁな。ロックはあたしの十八番だからな。でもさ、\nこの衣装で普通のコトやっても面白くないだろ？", "zh": "算是吧。摇滚可是我的拿手好戏。不过啊，穿着这身衣服做普通的事，也没意思吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7005_050jul", "source_sha256": "e8d31c22b8996bec3756d981b75bf097c8e40ab29b5f1795c8683aac25ec58cc", "ja": "せっかくならモンスターらしく、インパクトのある\n撮影にしたいんだよ！　なぁ、なんかいい案ないか？", "zh": "既然难得有这个机会，我想拍一组符合怪兽风格、充满冲击力的照片！　你说，有没有什么好主意？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7006_p", "source_sha256": "dd8784a51861867a3882805bebaf7e8843be1139140a197c38939b5fb6a827d3", "ja": "インパクトのあるロックバンドか……。\nそれなら……。", "zh": "有冲击力的摇滚乐队吗……。\n那样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7007", "source_sha256": "9a6086bd14251c3ae6a76b884e947f66c3d548e3e4b17345a6911754e0468ce2", "ja": "ハードに！", "zh": "更加努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7008", "source_sha256": "f9731d1df0cbbcca73e203c8de2c446ba617b630b0cc7e543d15dbd01beb0401", "ja": "フリーダムに！", "zh": "自由自在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7200_p", "source_sha256": "d094567cf1d0799fab9f2c11a3ddaff5360f6c54d0243df406aac1df15794991", "ja": "やっぱりモンスターだからな。人間離れした\nハードロックなイメージとかいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "毕竟是怪物嘛。超凡脱俗的\n硬摇滚风格感觉挺不错的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7201_050jul", "source_sha256": "729d75f1e194aa339142e0c985bd2af73ec7da1f3888638ebc93aea953554267", "ja": "なるほど……。確かに、生半可なハードさじゃ、\nロック好きのモンスターは満足させられないよな。", "zh": "原来如此……确实，硬派得不够彻底的话，可满足不了喜欢摇滚的怪兽啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7202_050jul", "source_sha256": "6f54f925c3a7216ea142e201f26a79a1690af1a2d3cd591b95d9a855e69798a4", "ja": "よし。撮影までウォーミングアップしてくるよ。\n今日は思いっきり暴れてやるぜ！", "zh": "好。拍摄开始前，我去热热身。今天就尽情闹个痛快吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7300_p", "source_sha256": "d094567cf1d0799fab9f2c11a3ddaff5360f6c54d0243df406aac1df15794991", "ja": "やっぱりモンスターだからな。人間離れした\nハードロックなイメージとかいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "毕竟是怪物嘛。超凡脱俗的\n硬摇滚风格感觉挺不错的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7301_050jul", "source_sha256": "15f9e08199486d8d81172632d617b95a0fe9e9005848a264c853eb28a1a5854a", "ja": "人間離れか……。口で言うのは簡単だけど、\nグラビアで表現するの難しくないか？", "zh": "超凡脱俗啊……说起来容易，可要在写真里表现出来，不是很难吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7302_050jul", "source_sha256": "06106f5e77a3a48bb6ef5e5cdc386e839b9d847ccd9caa425afc026b3137123e", "ja": "特殊メイクだと衣装の良さが消えちまうし……おい！\n提案したのはあんただろ？　一緒に考えてくれ。", "zh": "用特效妆的话，服装的优点就体现不出来了……喂！  \n提议可是你提的吧？跟我一起想想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7500_p", "source_sha256": "04af18dbcbbafd3af4d8809bdc1c42bb722d9dc97de2fd69720cc06758cd0b8e", "ja": "型にはまらないのがモンスターだ。自由で型破りな\n新しいロックを考えてみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "不拘一格才是怪物。不如去构想一种自由且打破常规的、\n全新的摇滚风格，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7501_050jul", "source_sha256": "a0ab836ccbfe497622537cfa63e8e4c7e91bd5247db269ff8a65d96c30f042b5", "ja": "はーん。新しいロックスタイルを作るってことか……。\nはは、面白そうだな！", "zh": "嗯——也就是说，要创作一种全新的摇滚风格吗……  \n哈哈，听起来挺有意思的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7502_050jul", "source_sha256": "ed4f6723d4957bb482950ee9a5c6755ed1872769e9a1c5e35cd065e9789c5c0e", "ja": "スケルトン達が自由に奏でるロック……おっ。いい\nアイディアが浮かんできた！　ギターとってくるよ！", "zh": "骷髅们自由演奏的摇滚……哦，想到个不错的主意！我去拿吉他！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7600_p", "source_sha256": "04af18dbcbbafd3af4d8809bdc1c42bb722d9dc97de2fd69720cc06758cd0b8e", "ja": "型にはまらないのがモンスターだ。自由で型破りな\n新しいロックを考えてみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "不拘一格才是怪物。不如去构想一种自由且打破常规的、\n全新的摇滚风格，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7601_050jul", "source_sha256": "ac6041afc847801467f6d11a6b857234814a9f15f87cac851659f87adb4e6367", "ja": "なら、人間がやりそうにないことをやってみる\nなんてのもいいかもな。", "zh": "那就试试看做些人类不会做的事，也许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_7602_050jul", "source_sha256": "2034eeb80d602f3c926281eef5b93553d6259ed818068e1b075adaf5dc5e5503", "ja": "スケルトンだし、自分の骨をドラムスティックに\nしてみるとか！　あ、骨の小道具なんてあったかな？", "zh": "毕竟是骷髅嘛，要不要试试把自己的骨头做成鼓槌！啊，有没有骨头道具来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
